  "description": "Zero-dependency .NET cryptography helpers: SHA-256 and HMAC-SHA256 hashing with constant-time verification, PBKDF2 password hashing, and AES-GCM authenticated encryption with associated data.",
  "id": "Fayakun.Security.Cryptography",
  "isPrerelease": false,
