  "packageHash": "4ny683fcbKNRsrGelSS6vHXUSG8WJ5KUV8q3zAhqnDTOeOG4injANCTxRhVAb8vRW9CxpXi0LJ/w+ChwoT87RQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 66439,
  "published": "2026-11-09T11:04:36.93Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0\n- New target: netcoreapp3.1.\n- New: HmacSha256Hasher for keyed hashing (recommended for storing API keys and tokens).\n- New: PasswordHasher using PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (600,000 iterations by default, per OWASP) with NeedsRehash support.\n- New: AesGcmEncryption associated-data (AAD) overloads, EncryptBytes/DecryptBytes, TryDecrypt, GenerateKey and IsSupported.\n- New: Sha256Hasher.ComputeHash for raw bytes.\n- Faster: one-shot SHA256.HashData / HMACSHA256.HashData on .NET 6+, and AES-GCM writes straight into the output buffer.\n- Plaintext buffers are zeroed after use. The encrypted payload format (v1) is unchanged.",
